{"4016050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nyx legacy", "steam_appid": 4016050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been devastated by a mysterious virus.<br>Cities collapse, nature twists, and humanity is pushed to the edge — yet hope still lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Nyx: Legacy</strong>, you follow <strong>Lyn</strong>, the protective older sister, and <strong>Nyx</strong>, her reckless yet fearless younger sister. Together they fight for survival in a world where danger is everywhere.<br><br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storytelling</strong>: Experience a heartfelt tale of sisterhood filled with hope, despair, and determination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic RPG Feel</strong>: Inspired by <i>Lufia I &amp; II</i>, with a modern twist on puzzles, dungeons, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Gameplay</strong>: Balanced mix of exploration, combat, and story progression — never just filler.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutated Monsters</strong>: Face enemies shaped by bizarre and unexpected mutations, each designed to surprise and unsettle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: Unlock <i>New Game Plus</i> and dynamic difficulty options for a fresh challenge after completing the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Hours of Content</strong> (estimated): A full RPG adventure with puzzles, dungeons, and memorable encounters.<br><br>This is not a tale of heroes or destiny. <i>Nyx: Legacy</i> is a story of survival of two sisters holding on to each other even when their world falls apart.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been devastated by a mysterious virus.<br>Cities collapse, nature twists, and humanity is pushed to the edge — yet hope still lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Nyx: Legacy</strong>, you follow <strong>Lyn</strong>, the protective older sister, and <strong>Nyx</strong>, her reckless yet fearless younger sister. Together they fight for survival in a world where danger is everywhere.<br><br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storytelling</strong>: Experience a heartfelt tale of sisterhood filled with hope, despair, and determination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic RPG Feel</strong>: Inspired by <i>Lufia I &amp; II</i>, with a modern twist on puzzles, dungeons, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Gameplay</strong>: Balanced mix of exploration, combat, and story progression — never just filler.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutated Monsters</strong>: Face enemies shaped by bizarre and unexpected mutations, each designed to surprise and unsettle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: Unlock <i>New Game Plus</i> and dynamic difficulty options for a fresh challenge after completing the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Hours of Content</strong> (estimated): A full RPG adventure with puzzles, dungeons, and memorable encounters.<br><br>This is not a tale of heroes or destiny. <i>Nyx: Legacy</i> is a story of survival of two sisters holding on to each other even when their world falls apart.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A mysterious virus has devastated the world. Two girls must fight for survival, facing deadly enemies and forging bonds that will be tested at every step.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016050/22b0e1647a5308c2a2ad6b4541c7d16b90c2e96d/header.jpg?t=1769628732", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016050/67dcbe09566c13236785820e6f0d588f06da6